## Lore

The Hunter-Gatherer is the Ikteks'' traditional way of life, carried over
from a home world where they were always running from something bigger.
These Diggers live off the land as nomads: they trap and track game, dig
shelters and tunnels, read the terrain, forage for plants and keep moving.
Their training is Stone Age in nature, with spears, rope, hides and
digging tools, though a Hunter-Gatherer who takes to technology can pick up
radios, rifles and modern armor along the way.

## GM Notes

The book introduces this occupation with the Iktek Diggers; about 29% of
them keep to it on Rifts Earth.

Those who have taken up some technology also carry a short-range radio, a
conventional rifle or shotgun with 144 rounds, and an energy rifle of choice
with two spare E-Clips. Hunter-Gatherers rarely build up wealth and trade
what they have for food, clothing and survival gear.
